<SCENARIO VER="105">
<TXSPN>Now, I understand that this time you wish to begin from the second arc, 'the <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="めいちょう">Meicho</STYLE> Arc [Clear Sign],' but there are several points to note.<PG>
Should you, having heard these points, wish to start over from the beginning, please do not hesitate to tell me.<PG>
First: all the scenarios you viewed in the Jusatsu Arc [Killing by Curse] are marked as played.<PG>
However, please be advised that some scenarios have been revised.<PG>
Second: the References and the Encyclopedia are all in an unviewed state.<PG>
And third: the Chatter within the range of the Jusatsu Arc [Killing by Curse] is all completed, with some exceptions.<PG>
Furthermore, there are several things whose specifications have changed.<PG>
Scenarios, References and Chatter will add to your 'Points.' The concept of Points did not exist last time.<PG>
These Points are used in order to view particular References.<PG>
If you begin from the second arc, the Points obtainable in the Jusatsu Arc [Killing by Curse] will be provided to you from the start.<PG>
The References that use these Points are in the 'Letters' format, which also appeared last time. The Points are used when viewing these References.<PG>
For details, please see the help in the Letters References.<PG>
Additionally, References in a further, unknown format have been added as well. Their unlock conditions are strict, so I do hope you will seek them out.<PG>
That was lengthy, but those are the points to note. To summarize―<PG>
1. Scenarios revised　2. Scenarios: all viewed, References and Encyclopedia: all <STYLE ID="2">un</STYLE>viewed, Chatter: <STYLE ID="2">partly</STYLE> unviewed　3. The concept of Points exists<PG>
Now that you have heard all this, allow me to confirm whether you will begin from the second arc.<PG>
Will you begin from the second arc, 'the <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="めいちょう">Meicho</STYLE> Arc [Clear Sign]'?
{PAUSE ""}
{}
